    "preview": "Uken Games\nGAMES\nCOMPANY\nCAREERS\nNEWS\nGAMES\nMattel Match\nWho Wants To Be A Millionaire\nJeopardy! World Tour\nAva's Manor\nTim's Word Challenge\nKings of Pool\nCOMPANY\nCAREERS\nNEWS\nOUR COMPANY\nUken builds games that people play for years. We believe in small, empowered teams with the autonomy to make their own decisions about how to delight our players.\nYour browser does not support the video tag.\nOUR JOURNEY: BUILDING GAMES THAT CONNECT\nUken's story began in 2009 with a simple idea: make games that people love. It all started with Game Wars, a breakout hit that set the stage for bigger dreams. In 2019, Uken expanded its vision, launching the cozy narrative experience Ava's Manor.\nPartnering with Sony, Uken transformed legendary game shows like Who Wants to Be a Millionaire and Jeopardy! World Tour into mobile adventures enjoyed worldwide. Today, driven by data, creativity, and small-but-mighty teams, Uken collaborates with entertainment leaders to reimagine games as an essential part of th"
